# MEDBOURSE Engineering

- REST under `/api/v1`; versioned, consistent error JSON.
- Shared types and enums in `@medbourse/shared`; avoid duplicating domain types in web.
- Validate input at API boundary (Zod when introduced).
- No secrets in code; use `.env` via central config module.
- Financial and workflow transitions: server-side validation + audit log hooks.
- Document new endpoints in `docs/API.md` and eventual OpenAPI when implemented.

See `docs/SECURITY.md` for authorization and document access requirements.
